From 660ecfa111ab42771ed82d797f3d1cc442a561cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NiklasHeckmann <niklas.heckmann@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:32:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Experiment: negotiated-congestion history cost
 (PathFinder-style) and min_trace_width_um

The congestion history is off by default; on the DAC2020 and KiCad demo boards it gave no
measurable gain. Kept for reference.
